    "cssHidden_focus_hint_cantTell": "Make the element visible when it can receive keyboard focus, or remove it from the tab order until it is visible.",
    "cssHidden_focus_summary_cantTell_redirect": "Focusable {{element}} appears visually hidden, but focus moved immediately to another element. Verify sentinel/focus-trap behavior.",
    "cssHidden_focus_hint_cantTell_redirect": "Verify this is an intentional focus sentinel/focus-trap handoff and that keyboard users never remain on visually hidden focus targets.",
